        "deleted_at": null,
        "description": "Twaganiriye ku bintu bimwe vyerekana itandukaniro hagati y'abana b'Imana n'ab'isi. Mw'ijambo ryo gukunda bene data, twari tumaze iminsi twihweza twisunze igice ca 4 ca 1 Yohana biratomoye ko tudakwiye gupfa kwumva ko twogira ubucuti no kwifatanya n'abari bo bose. Tutiyubaye ngo tugenze impwemu ko zoba ari iziva ku Mana turashobora gusanga twifatanije n'impwemu za antikristo, tugashigikira ibikorwa vy'umwiza. Akageresho canke igipimo co kudufasha kumenya impwemu za antikristo canke abigisha b'ibinyoma tugasanga muri 1 Yohana 4 : 2 - 3. Twarangiri ku majambo yo guhanura abana b'Imana ngo bakundane ariko atari rwa rukundo rwo mw'isi rujanye n'ivy'ukwubakana canke ubusambanyi canke ubundi bucuti, oya n'urukundo rw'Imana rutuma abayizera bose bababarana bakumva ko barumwe. Uwundafise urukundo rwo gukunda bene data turabona ivyiwe mu ncamake muri 1 Yohana 4 : 8 ngo uwudakundana ntazi Imana kuko Imana ari urukundo.",
