        "description": "Mu kiganiro giheruka twaciye hirya no hino ijambo rivuga yuko Umwami Yesu Kristo ariwe bugingo. Uwumwizera akmwakira nk'Umukiza aba yakiriye ubwo bugingo budashira. Twarumvise yuko hari abihenda ngo n'abana b'Imana kubera ko bari mw'ishengero kandi bahafise ibikorwa, ariko twibuke yuko uwo wese atarizera Umwami Yesu ngo amwakire mu bugingo bwiwe aba ataracika umwana w'Imana. Twarangirije k'umurongo 1 Yohana 5 : 12 ,haravuga ngo: Uwufise Umwana wayo niwe afise ubwo bugingo, uwudafise Umwana w\"Imana ntafise ubwo bugingo.",
