        "deleted_at": null,
        "description": "Twaganiriye kuvyerekeye urukundo mu bana b'Imana.Twarumvise yuko urukundo ari ikimenyetso gikomeye kibaranga ko ar'abana b'Imana. Turibuka ingene urukundo ari co cagezwe umwami Yesu yashimikiyeko akanacita icagezwe gisha nk'uko tubibona ( Yohana : 13: 34 - 35 canke mu cete ca 1 Yohana 3:23 ) Twarangije rero ikiganiro cacu twibukanya ivy'ugusuzuma abavugishwa n'Imana ko ari ab'ukuri ( 1 Yohana 4:1). Uwu Yohana rero yandikiye abana b'Imana ababwira ivy'ugukundana n'ugufashanya niwe nyene kandi yabandikiye n'ivy'ukwiyubara ngo ntibapfe kwemera impwemu izarizo zose. Ugukundana nivyiza ariko tumeneyeko tuba mw'isi y'ivyaha yuzuyemwo abababeshi, yuzuyemwo n'inkozi z'ibibi z'uburyo bwose. Nico gituma dutegerezwa kwiyubara mu ngendo zacu. Burya rero hari aho abantu bashobora kwegera abakozi b'Imana bigira abakristo ariko ataribo mugabo bifitiye izindi ntumbero.",
