        "description": "Twuvimvise ukuntu Imana ishimikira kugukundana kw'abana bayo. Abavyawe n'Imana barangwa n'urukundo nk'uko Umwami Yesu yabivuze (Yohana : 13:35 ) Hano naho muri 1 Yohana 3:15 turabona ingene uwanka benedata aboneka nk'umubisha akomeye Imbere y'Imana. Amajambo ahari aravuga ngo uwanka mwenedata wundi n'umwicanyi kandi murazi ko atamwicanyi yogira ubugingo budashira ngo bugume muriwe uwo mwicanyi nawe Imana iramukunda ariko ikanka ubwicanyi bwiwe. Ni kubw'urwo rukundo rero Imana yatanze Umwana wayo Yesu Kristo ngo apfe kugirango abanyavyaha baronke agakiza n'abicanyi barimwo na benedata rero bandi dukwiye kutabanka ukwo yatwitangiye niko natwe dusabwa kwitanga mu buryo butandukanye mugufashanya na benedata .",
